      "message": "Well, the Volla Phone kernel is open source: https://github.com/HelloVolla/android_kernel_volla_mt6763\n\nBut debugging \u0026 fixing the bug in there wouldn\u0027t fix it for the other devices, therefore this patch is the best solution.",
